OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies welcome progress in
OL,4,Amaternity care inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FBereaved families have welcomed new
OL,7,Fdetails of an independent review into
OL,8,Fmaternity care in Leeds, including the
OL,9,Fnature of cases set to be considered.
OL,11,FLast year former Health Secretary Wes
OL,12,FStreeting announced a review into Leeds
OL,13,FTeaching Hospitals NHS Trust (LTHT)
OL,14,Fafter "repeated failures" over its
OL,15,Fmaternity services came to light.
OL,17,FIt came after a BBC investigation
OL,18,Frevealed that the deaths of at least 56
OL,19,Fbabies and two mothers at LTHT over the
OL,20,Fpast five years may have been
OL,21,Fprevented.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
